---
config:
  fontFamily: "Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
  theme: base
  themeCSS: ".edgeLabel rect { opacity: 1 !important; } .cluster-label .nodeLabel { text-align: center; }"
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: "Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
    fontSize: "14px"
    primaryColor: "#FFFFFF"
    secondaryColor: "#FFFFFF"
    tertiaryColor: "#FFFFFF"
    background: "#FFFFFF"
    primaryBorderColor: "#181818"
    primaryTextColor: "#000000"
    lineColor: "#181818"
    textColor: "#000000"
    noteBkgColor: "#FEFFDD"
    noteBorderColor: "#181818"
    noteTextColor: "#000000"
    clusterBkg: "#FFFFFF"
    clusterBorder: "#181818"
    edgeLabelBackground: "#FFFFFF"
---
%% RobustViews::loopDefinitions — definition rendering (view def GeneralView, filter @Definition)
%% not represented: 4 exposed standard library element(s) not drawn; a definition rendering draws the model's own elements
flowchart TD
  n0["`*«part def»*
**Loops::A**`"]
  n1["`*«part def»*
**Loops::B**`"]
  n2["`*«requirement def»*
**Loops::Looped**`"]
  n3["`*«part def»*
**Cycles::C**`"]
  n0 ---|"◆ b"| n1
  n1 ---|"◆ a"| n0
